kages, health benefits, company vehicle (field), and career advancement opportunities. Join an exceptional company with exceptional people that can furnish the right person an exciting and rewarding career.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<a href=\"https://jobs.dayforcehcm.com/en-US/nearu/Russells\" target=\"_blank\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"false\" class=\"cta\">\n    <span >View Open Positions</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1916\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2025/06/A-Best-Places-to-Work-trophy-for-Russells-American-Mechanical.webp\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A-Best-Places-to-Work-trophy-for-Russells-American-Mechanical\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2025/06/A-Best-Places-to-Work-trophy-for-Russells-American-Mechanical.webp 1916w, /images/2025/06/A-Best-Places-to-Work-trophy-for-Russells-American-Mechanical-300x200.webp 300w, /images/2025/06/A-Best-Places-to-Work-trophy-for-Russells-American-Mechanical-1024x684.webp 1024w, /images/2025/06/A-Best-Places-to-Work-trophy-for-Russells-American-Mechanical-768x513.webp 768w, /images/2025/06/A-Best-Places-to-Work-trophy-for-Russells-American-Mechanical-1536x1026.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" title=\"A-Best-Places-to-Work-trophy-for-Russells-American-Mechanical - Russell’s American Mechanical\" /></figure>\n\t